text:
Matrix multiplication and Leslie matrix
\[
    \begin{bmatrix}
      n_{1,t+1} \\
      n_{2,t+1} \\
      n_{3,t+1} \\
      n_{4,t+1}
    \end{bmatrix}
    =
    \begin{bmatrix}
      f_1 & f_2 & f_3 & f_4 \\
      s_1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\
      0 & s_2 & 0 & 0 \\
      0 & 0 & s_3 & 0
    \end{bmatrix}
    \times
    \begin{bmatrix}
      n_{1,t} \\
      n_{2,t} \\
      n_{3,t} \\
      n_{4,t}
    \end{bmatrix}
\]
